      "source_unit_id": "isabah-usul-4CPCkl83K7:entry:8302:db6462c23a4f0740",
      "arabic": "٨٣٠٢- ميسرة:\nغلام خديجة.\nذكر في السّيرة، وكان رفيق النبيّ ﵌ في تجارة خديجة قبل أن يتزوجها. وحكى بعض أدلة نبوته، وترجم له ابن عساكر، ولم أقف على رواية صريحة بأنه بقي إلى البعثة، فكتبته على الاحتمال.",
      "english": "8302—Maysara:\n\nKhadija’s servant.\n\nHe is mentioned in the Sira. He accompanied the Prophet ﷺ in Khadija’s trading venture before he married her. He recounted some of the proofs of his prophethood. Ibn Asakir wrote a biographical notice for him. I have not found any explicit report that he lived until the beginning of the prophetic mission, so I have included him on that possibility.",
